                                                                  <li style="margin: 0;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, geneva, sans-serif, Arial; font-size: 13px;"><strong>Dernier avis d’imposition</strong></span></li>
                                                                  <li style="margin: 0;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, geneva, sans-serif, Arial; font-size: 13px;"><strong>Pièce d’identité (CNI ou passeport)</strong></span></li>
